      "category": "stack",
      "description": "Ensures QjackCtl RT (Realtime=true, Priority=90) and CPU pinning (default cores 0,1). Updates the active preset (if any) and mirrors unscoped settings while preserving user presets, disables ServerConfig so GUI settings are used, and configures a QjackCtl PostStartupScript to re-pin JACK on start. Optional: change cores via Config. If JACK is running, CPU affinity is updated immediately; status checks also use live JACK RT threads when available.",
